{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":488331,"name":"Jeffrey Nead","username":"Jeffrey_Nead","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/j/c4cdca/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-10T18:25:36.483Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488331-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488331-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488331-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488331-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen you enter API keys with the secure in-chat card, they land in the computer’s secret store. Later — after sleep, a connection drop, or quitting/reopening the Grok Bot app — that store gets emptied. We then can’t create service requests in MIPP until you re-enter both keys. Happened ~6 times today alone. Cursor staff already confirmed this on another user’s report: reconnect sync overwrites in-chat secrets.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488331-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488331-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEnter secrets via Grok Bot secure secret-request (in-chat card), not pasted in chat.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConfirm they exist in the box secrets store.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLet the desktop app reconnect (PC sleep, connection drop, or quit/reopen Grok Bot).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCheck the secrets store again.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488331-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488331-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSecrets entered via secure secret-request should stay until I remove them. A reconnect should not wipe/overwrite the store.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488331-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488331-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488331-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488331-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVersion: 0.44.0\u003cbr\u003e\nRelease Track: stable\u003cbr\u003e\nOS: win32\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488331-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488331-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2026-09-10T18:25:49.783Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":5,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":25.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":171280,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-box-secrets-wiped-on-desktop-reconnect-mipp-api-keys-production-blocker","display_username":"Jeffrey Nead","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137213,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-box-secrets-wiped-on-desktop-reconnect-mipp-api-keys-production-blocker/171280/1","reactions":[],"current